      "title": "Mercedes-Benz Museum",
      "description": "Automobile museum in Stuttgart, Germany",
      "extract": "The Mercedes-Benz Museum is an automobile museum in Stuttgart, Germany. It covers the history of the Mercedes-Benz brand and the brands associated with it. Stuttgart is home to the Mercedes-Benz brand and the international headquarters of the Mercedes-Benz Group.",
